One OpenShift project is one stack (one Route; many in-memory parties). Log in as cluster-admin first; `./install.sh` refuses to run without `oc whoami`. `--no-add-gpu-nodes` skips cloning a GPU MachineSet. vLLM + Granite 3.2 8B Instruct + `nvidia.com/gpu: 1`. Tekton PipelineRun copies ModelCar weights (no HF token, no MinIO). No Ollama, no native image, no extra Routes, no command-runner pod. Never commit kubeconfigs or workshop API URLs. Quality: `./verify.sh`.
